{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》戰況激烈，求愛勇者Alan為奪女神Amber芳心，竟徹底改變形象！他由以往憑「真誠溫柔」Tone贏得女神及網民歡心的路線，180度大轉變，化身「小學雞」瘋狂搞笑。Alan更上演呷醋戲碼，卻被花生團成員當場狠批，究竟他這招是加分還是減分？\n</p>\n<h2>Alan化身小學雞冧Amber 瘋狂震波兼捉字蝨</h2>\n<p>在Amber的「心跳電話亭」環節中，主要戰火集中在Alan及阿朗之間。為了討好感覺像「小妹妹」的Amber，Alan決定放棄穩重形象，全程化身「小學雞」，不但頻頻針對情敵阿朗的發言「捉字蝨」，更上演無厘頭的「震波」搞笑戲碼，行為相當出位。沒想到這套玩味十足的追求方式，反而成功讓Amber覺得「冇咁緊張」，令現場氣氛變得甜蜜又搞笑，效果出奇地好。</p>\n<h2>Alan直球呷醋情敵阿朗 梁敏巧吐槽太油膩</h2>\n<p>Alan的「小學雞」行為一浪接一浪，當他成功獲得進入電話亭的權利後，在閒聊期間驚悉Amber竟是與情敵阿朗一同坐車到拍攝場地時，他立即醋意大發，先是大叫「咁Close」，接著更輕聲追加一句：「有啲呷醋喎」。這個直球式的呷醋宣言，雖然充滿戲劇效果，卻引來花生團成員梁敏巧（Maggie）的無情吐槽，直指他表現「太油膩」，場面相當爆笑。</p>\n<h2>Alan轉玩搞Gag路線 兩度唔記得帶禮物勁另類</h2>\n<p>事實上，Alan這次轉玩「搞Gag」路線可謂相當徹底。他在拉票時，曾揚言為Amber親手準備了小禮物，以展示誠意，但沒想到他竟然兩次都忘記帶到現場，這種「另類」的甩轆表現，與他早前建立的「真誠溫柔」形象形成極大反差，雖然令人哭笑不得，卻也成功加深了其幽默搞笑的新人設，讓觀眾留下深刻印象。</p>\n<h2>網民笑爆：呢種小學雞追女仔好可愛</h2>\n<p>Alan的形象大轉變引來網民熱議，不少人對他的「小學雞」追求方式表示受落。網民紛紛留言：「Alan呢種小學雞追女仔方式雖然好尷尬，但又幾可愛喎！」、「笑死，呷醋個樣好真實，但梁敏巧個吐槽先係重點！」、「唔記得帶禮物真係神操作，廢到笑。」、「Amber好似幾受落，證明呢招work！」、「我覺得有啲油膩，都係鍾意佢之前溫柔個樣多啲。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_6738856006adaf5e9d0fcd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_6738856006adaf5e9d0fcd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_20798904676adaf5f27ead2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_20798904676adaf5f27ead2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_11607826406adaf5f582ddb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_11607826406adaf5f582ddb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_6069964786adaf5f895b0f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_6069964786adaf5f895b0f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_171367386adaf608274bc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_171367386adaf608274bc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/35_16898998476adaf60b3c75d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/35_16898998476adaf60b3c75d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/37_20052778336adaf61198584.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/37_20052778336adaf61198584.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/40_4990018966adaf61b47b11.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/40_4990018966adaf61b47b11.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/41_11017858886adaf61e3f871.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/41_11017858886adaf61e3f871.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T10:24:03.769562+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1188,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:00:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T10:38:18.417055+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T10:18:27.454185+00:00","content_hash":"854d15ddc4fb2cae6022623959faf6d132f80baa08a4adc460b9ea5941b9fd90","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}